  "title": "Parag Naik Appointed to Lead FreeStream&apos;s Direct-to-Mobile Strategy as CEO and CTO",
  "summary": "Delhi and Baltimore – 17 June 2026 Free Stream Technologies (“FreeStream”), incubated at the Indian Institute of Technology (IIT), Kanpur, today announced that Parag Naik has been appointed Chief Executive Officer and Chief Technology Officer. Naik will lead FreeStream’s next phase of growth, guiding the company’s strategic direction, technology roadmap, platform development, and commercialization efforts...",
